  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7311001",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "731100101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "731100101": {
            "id": "731100101",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "Phew, it's a lot cooler here. Mind letting me see the slate?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100102"
            ]
          },
          "731100102": {
            "id": "731100102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Soheil examines the slate, alternating between frowning and marveling.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100103"
            ]
          },
          "731100103": {
            "id": "731100103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, you're spending too much time on this! You're not trying to commit the text to memory and skimp on our pay, are you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100104"
            ]
          },
          "731100104": {
            "id": "731100104",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "Sorry, I was just so fascinated. This is my first time seeing writing like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100105"
            ]
          },
          "731100105": {
            "id": "731100105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Any discoveries?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100106"
            ]
          },
          "731100106": {
            "id": "731100106",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "Hmm... Some of it looks like a construction log... It mentions \"Aaru,\" but there's no way to know if it's in any way connected to Aaru Village. Too bad the records say little more...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100107"
            ]
          },
          "731100107": {
            "id": "731100107",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "But this discovery is certainly worth several pages of writing. Thank you very much. Here, as per our agreement.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100112",
              "731100110"
            ]
          },
          "731100112": {
            "id": "731100112",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "My next step would be to find a bigger collection of primary materials, but that's going to be difficult without going into the desert...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100113"
            ]
          },
          "731100113": {
            "id": "731100113",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "Oh, I have an idea! If you have the time, please hear me out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100114"
            ]
          },
          "731100114": {
            "id": "731100114",
            "speakerId": 20821,
            "speakerName": "Hulwani",
            "text": "Mr. Soheil, are you thinking...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100115"
            ]
          },
          "731100115": {
            "id": "731100115",
            "speakerId": 20821,
            "speakerName": "Hulwani",
            "text": "The sage prohibits any researcher from going into the desert.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100116"
            ]
          },
          "731100116": {
            "id": "731100116",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "Now, I wouldn't dare challenge the sage's authority, but I'm sure he never prohibited the giving of gifts, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100117"
            ]
          },
          "731100117": {
            "id": "731100117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gifts? What are you going to give us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100118"
            ]
          },
          "731100118": {
            "id": "731100118",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "Something very precious... My archaeology notes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100119"
            ]
          },
          "731100119": {
            "id": "731100119",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "To be honest, I ventured into the desert more than a dozen years ago, but didn't find anything special other than noting the locations of several potential ruins.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100120"
            ]
          },
          "731100120": {
            "id": "731100120",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "I believe it's fate that brought me back here to make your acquaintance in these ruins, so I want you to have these notes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100121"
            ]
          },
          "731100121": {
            "id": "731100121",
            "speakerId": 20821,
            "speakerName": "Hulwani",
            "text": "Are you trying to... I get it. That isn't against the rules, but I'm afraid your actions would...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100122"
            ]
          },
          "731100122": {
            "id": "731100122",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "#My actions? I am simply presenting a gift as a celebration of my friendship with {NICKNAME} the big hero and Paimon the little hero. Isn't that more than fair?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100123"
            ]
          },
          "731100123": {
            "id": "731100123",
            "speakerId": 20821,
            "speakerName": "Hulwani",
            "text": "I suppose..."
          },
          "731100110": {
            "id": "731100110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right! If we weren't trying to prove Tirzad correct, we wouldn't have found this slate!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100111"
            ]
          },
          "731100111": {
            "id": "731100111",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "You're right. Tirzad's the one I should be thanking — yes, indeed!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7311008",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "731100801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "731100801": {
            "id": "731100801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We explored the Tomb of Carouses.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100802"
            ]
          },
          "731100802": {
            "id": "731100802",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "So you went to the Tomb of Carouses... It's a miniature version of the Mausoleum of King Deshret, just like I said, right? So, any new discoveries?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100803"
            ]
          },
          "731100803": {
            "id": "731100803",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You recount your exploration of the Tomb of Carouses to Soheil and give him the stone slate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100804"
            ]
          },
          "731100804": {
            "id": "731100804",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "It sounds like you didn't find anything special. I guess size isn't the only difference between the two locations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100805"
            ]
          },
          "731100805": {
            "id": "731100805",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "And as for this slate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100806"
            ]
          },
          "731100806": {
            "id": "731100806",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What is it, what is it? It has so many words, so it's got to be valuable, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100807"
            ]
          },
          "731100807": {
            "id": "731100807",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "From what I can tell, it's an ordinary fable that features some animals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100808"
            ]
          },
          "731100808": {
            "id": "731100808",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? How can this be?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100809"
            ]
          },
          "731100809": {
            "id": "731100809",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "But that's okay, I can still squeeze a paper out of this, albeit a short one...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731100810"
            ]
          },
          "731100810": {
            "id": "731100810",
            "speakerId": 4245,
            "speakerName": "Soheil",
            "text": "\"The Retreat of the Sheep: A Preliminary Study of Environmental Change in the Desert.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
